WEBVTT

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:16.884
Abiru hodo dakiattari kuchizuke shitari

00:00:16.884 --> 00:00:23.090
Abiru hodo kenka shitari aishiattari

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:29.296
Ari no mama omae no koto shiritai kuse ni

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:35.035
Ari no mama nante narenai ore no hou sa

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:38.171
Wakaranai

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.908
Omae no kokoro ga

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:42.910
Nazedayo

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:47.548
Honto wa majutsushi kai?

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:51.718
Dakishimetai

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.322
Hitori ja cry

00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:59.993
Mou nido to hitori ja itakunai

00:01:01.328 --> 00:01:04.331
Dakishimetai

00:01:04.331 --> 00:01:07.634
Omae to fly

00:01:08.035 --> 00:01:15.409
Marude naiteru youna kanjiteru koe ni toketeiku

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:21.915
Serenade

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:36.496
There is only one way.

00:01:37.364 --> 00:01:41.435
Those changed by the power
of the Sword of Baltanders

00:01:41.435 --> 00:01:44.137
can only be restored by that sword.

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:48.075
But with my magic now, that sword is...

00:01:49.009 --> 00:01:51.945
Don't put on such a pitiful face.

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:54.548
Now there's only you.

00:01:55.115 --> 00:02:00.420
You're the only one who can save Azalie,
and then Childman.

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:03.223
Listen closely, okay?

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:08.095
There isn't anyone anywhere
who can control that sword.

00:02:08.095 --> 00:02:11.131
It's not because you aren't good enough.

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:13.700
It's because it is an incomplete sword.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:14.868
Incomplete?!

00:02:15.569 --> 00:02:22.476
Release from the sword's power
will only occur when the sword is whole.

00:02:22.476 --> 00:02:26.013
And only then can its power be controlled.

00:02:27.014 --> 00:02:30.283
So, to do that...

00:02:30.784 --> 00:02:32.586
To do that...

00:02:42.062 --> 00:02:43.096
Row...

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.799
To do that? What is "that"?

00:02:45.799 --> 00:02:48.001
The way to save Azalie?!

00:02:49.803 --> 00:02:52.572
| beg you. Row, tell me! Row!

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:55.042
Row, open your eyes. Row!

00:02:55.042 --> 00:02:56.576
Row, Row!

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.479
| beg of you, Row! What should 1?

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:00.447
What should I do? Row!

00:03:00.447 --> 00:03:01.715
It's no use, Orphen! Row's already...
What should I do? Row!

00:03:01.715 --> 00:03:02.849
It's no use, Orphen! Row's already...

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:09.456
It can't be.

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:13.060
To come all this way...

00:03:15.162 --> 00:03:21.168
you two hurry up
and rReturn that sword!

00:03:29.743 --> 00:03:31.244
Hey, look!

00:03:34.815 --> 00:03:36.416
Hey, Orphen!

00:03:44.291 --> 00:03:45.792
Orphen!

00:03:46.226 --> 00:03:47.994
What kind of face is that?

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:50.497
My breakfast's going to taste bad now!

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:53.467
That's a bad habit, you know?

00:03:53.467 --> 00:03:55.469
You think about Miss Azalie
and then get all gloomy.

00:03:55.469 --> 00:03:57.037
Like this.

00:03:57.704 --> 00:03:59.272
You know, you...

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:02.142
Don't start worrying after we've
already come this far!

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:08.381
You know, it will probably all turn out okay.

00:04:09.783 --> 00:04:15.355
Cleao, those words are the words of someone
who's actually trying to do something, right?

00:04:15.355 --> 00:04:16.990
That's right, Orphen.

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:19.159
So, it'll be all right. Probably.

00:04:19.159 --> 00:04:22.496
| guess so. Let's hurry up and
find Volcan and Dortin.

00:04:22.496 --> 00:04:24.331
Yep! Yep! That's the spirit.

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:28.702
Nothing can begin without
the Sword of Baltanders.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:43.416
It's all good. So bring it on!

00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:47.954
| don't think you should do these things.

00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:50.190
Don't worry about it, Dortin!

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:54.261
Excuse me, but when will we
be receiving payment?

00:04:55.195 --> 00:04:57.197
I've been telling you from the beginning

00:04:57.197 --> 00:05:01.334
that our underling Orphen will
be along later to pay for this.

00:05:01.334 --> 00:05:03.670
But with just those words...

00:05:04.771 --> 00:05:09.409
Okay, Pops, this is the
Sword of Baltanden... Batroralrusu...

00:05:09.409 --> 00:05:10.777
Baltanders.

00:05:10.777 --> 00:05:15.048
A very, very valuable antique.

00:05:15.048 --> 00:05:20.387
And do you think we, who are in possession
of this amazing sword, would eat and run?

00:05:20.587 --> 00:05:24.758
Now that you tell me, it does seem
to be some kind of large sword...

00:05:24.758 --> 00:05:27.727
So if you understand,
get me that Super Special Lunch, too!

00:05:27.727 --> 00:05:28.995
Hurry up!

00:05:30.297 --> 00:05:33.133
To pay with their names on the tab is...

00:05:33.133 --> 00:05:35.735
If we're found out, we'll be half-killed!

00:05:35.735 --> 00:05:36.770
What are you saying?

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:40.674
What's wrong with taking a small revenge
against that super evil sorcerer

00:05:40.674 --> 00:05:42.776
who's always getting in the way?

00:05:43.276 --> 00:05:45.879
Please don't let them find out!

00:05:47.247 --> 00:05:50.584
But it's times like these
when those two just don't show up!

00:05:50.951 --> 00:05:54.888
Really! Normally, they always
pop out and bother us!

00:05:55.322 --> 00:05:58.892
Really! It has to be now when they
don't show up for days!

00:05:59.226 --> 00:06:03.797
Master! A triple serving of the fillet steak,
and sea urchin, cod roe, salmon roe noodles!

00:06:03.797 --> 00:06:05.498
Oh, and make the meat rare.

00:06:05.498 --> 00:06:06.533
Welcome!

00:06:06.967 --> 00:06:09.436
The usual.

00:06:09.936 --> 00:06:11.238
Hey, you heard?

00:06:11.238 --> 00:06:14.708
Some sorcerer is looking for
a duo with a sword.

00:06:16.476 --> 00:06:18.211
Yeah, I heard that too.

00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:19.746
A sorcerer with evil eyes, right?

00:06:22.449 --> 00:06:24.551
Yeah, together with that girl
that looks strong willed,

00:06:24.551 --> 00:06:26.319
and a boy that looks like a porter.

00:06:29.489 --> 00:06:32.759
They looked desperate, like they were
looking for their parents' murderer.

00:06:34.794 --> 00:06:38.198
Thanks for waiting for your fillet steak,
the sea urchin, cod roe, salmon roe...

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:47.874
Those guys!

00:06:48.975 --> 00:06:49.976
Eat and run?

00:06:49.976 --> 00:06:52.245
Yes, they were awful!

00:06:52.245 --> 00:06:54.381
| should've just taken it from them
right then and there!

00:06:54.381 --> 00:06:56.182
That Sword of something or other.

00:06:56.516 --> 00:06:57.651
Those guys!

00:06:57.651 --> 00:07:00.754
Using the Sword of Baltanders
as a hedge for food!

00:07:00.754 --> 00:07:05.625
Really! They even lied about having
a servant named Orphen.

00:07:05.625 --> 00:07:08.361
If he really exists,
I'll give him a piece of my mind!

00:07:08.695 --> 00:07:11.998
SERVANT?!

00:07:12.432 --> 00:07:16.069
Those two! I'll beat them black and blue!

00:07:16.403 --> 00:07:19.973
Well, do you know which way they ran off?

00:07:19.973 --> 00:07:21.541
Are you going after them?

00:07:21.541 --> 00:07:24.945
| don't know what's up with you,
but you better not.

00:07:27.047 --> 00:07:31.184
According to everyone in town,
they ran off towards the Giga Sequoia.

00:07:31.184 --> 00:07:32.585
Towards the Giga Sequoia?

00:07:32.585 --> 00:07:33.920
Giga Sequoia?

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:36.890
It's a famous giant tree, the Giga Sequoia.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.694
It's something you look at from afar.
You better give up on going.

00:07:40.694 --> 00:07:43.163
You don't know what kind of danger
you'll find yourself in.

00:07:43.663 --> 00:07:44.664
Danger?

00:07:44.664 --> 00:07:47.167
So, what exactly is there, anyway?

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:57.143
Look at this! Wow!

00:07:57.143 --> 00:07:59.746
It really is a big tree, isn't it?

00:07:59.913 --> 00:08:03.683
Yeah, but it seems the tree's not
the only big thing around here.

00:08:03.883 --> 00:08:05.251
What do you mean?

00:08:05.251 --> 00:08:08.722
It seems the animals that live here,
even the bugs, are big.

00:08:09.889 --> 00:08:11.825
| don't want any more giant spiders!

00:08:11.825 --> 00:08:16.896
No matter how stupid they are, I don't think
they'd hide in the top of this tree.

00:08:18.365 --> 00:08:22.569
That's why I told you we should
go around the tree's roots.

00:08:22.902 --> 00:08:26.873
Shut up. As if the Battle Hound of
Mazmaturia, Sir Volcan Polkano,

00:08:26.873 --> 00:08:28.708
would go around something!

00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:30.844
To follow the destined path in
a straightforward fashion,

00:08:30.844 --> 00:08:32.846
is the path a man should chose.

00:08:32.846 --> 00:08:34.147
Is it the path a man escapes from?

00:08:34.147 --> 00:08:34.981
YOU!

00:08:34.981 --> 00:08:36.316
Don't move!

00:08:36.316 --> 00:08:37.784
What'll you do, Big Brother?

00:08:37.784 --> 00:08:38.651
He said not to move!

00:08:38.651 --> 00:08:39.419
Move!

00:08:39.419 --> 00:08:40.220
B-Big Brother!

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:43.256
Damn, playing chase in a place like this.

00:08:43.256 --> 00:08:44.891
Don't let your guard down, okay?

00:08:45.258 --> 00:08:47.427
| understand, Master!

00:08:47.427 --> 00:08:50.230
Hey! You're making fun of me, aren't you?

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:52.265
Even though I may not look like it,
I'm an expert at climbing trees-

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:12.786
Nut bombs!

00:09:26.433 --> 00:09:28.802
We don't taste very good!

00:09:28.802 --> 00:09:31.271
You could even say we taste bad, yes.

00:09:43.583 --> 00:09:44.884
Big Brother...

00:09:44.884 --> 00:09:47.420
I'm saying we're not food for winter storage.

00:09:49.956 --> 00:09:51.057
Cleao!

00:09:51.691 --> 00:09:52.826
Cleao?

00:09:53.293 --> 00:09:56.963
It spins! Spins!

00:09:58.331 --> 00:10:01.101
This is no good.
Let's split up and follow them.

00:10:01.101 --> 00:10:02.602
Yes, Master!

00:10:07.874 --> 00:10:12.045
Okay, if we run in this kind of strange course,
even they won't be able to catch up.

00:10:12.045 --> 00:10:13.947
Weren't you going to go straight?

00:10:13.947 --> 00:10:15.248
Hey, good work, you two.

00:10:15.248 --> 00:10:16.316
Why are you here?

00:10:16.316 --> 00:10:17.684
Why, you say?

00:10:17.684 --> 00:10:20.553
You guys just came running down this way.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.322
You can't get away!

00:10:22.322 --> 00:10:23.957
Now quietly hand over the Sword of Baltanders.

00:10:24.324 --> 00:10:27.527
Like we would allow ourselves to be
captured by a half-assed sorcerer!

00:10:27.527 --> 00:10:31.131
| may be half-assed,
but I can use a little magic!

00:10:31.464 --> 00:10:33.466
Fly Away, Sword of Light!

00:10:33.466 --> 00:10:34.567
Just kidding.

00:10:36.603 --> 00:10:37.737
No way!

00:10:38.805 --> 00:10:40.340
No way!

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:41.808
Why?

00:10:45.712 --> 00:10:48.047
We came so far, we can relax a little.

00:10:48.047 --> 00:10:49.849
You mean we fell so far, right?

00:10:52.719 --> 00:10:54.120
Oh, dear, sorry!

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:57.557
You wench! What do you mean
using us as a doormat?!

00:10:57.557 --> 00:10:59.692
I'll scrape you to death
with dried bonito shavings!

00:10:59.692 --> 00:11:02.362
What are you saying?
You can't run anymore!

00:11:02.595 --> 00:11:06.332
Idiot! You don't think you can
stand up to us with that twig?

00:11:06.332 --> 00:11:07.767
| guess you mean to die!

00:11:13.173 --> 00:11:17.210
It's a giant walking stick!

00:11:24.551 --> 00:11:27.053
No! No! It's disgusting!

00:11:33.259 --> 00:11:36.029
Whoops...

00:11:38.765 --> 00:11:42.902
We came so far...

00:11:42.902 --> 00:11:47.240
| think it's better if you don't say those lines.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:53.479
Tag's over, one-cell brain siblings.

00:11:53.846 --> 00:11:55.148
See, I told you.

00:11:55.148 --> 00:11:56.449
Orphen...

00:11:57.283 --> 00:11:59.185
What happened to you guys?

00:11:59.185 --> 00:12:01.854
| don't want you to worry about me!

00:12:02.822 --> 00:12:03.990
Whatever.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:06.793
Then why don't you hurry up and return that?

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:08.127
Or else...

00:12:08.127 --> 00:12:09.796
Well, haven't you played enough?

00:12:13.399 --> 00:12:16.502
Big Brother, it'd be better if you apologized.

00:12:16.502 --> 00:12:21.107
He might give us a break and
only quarter-kill us instead of half-kill.

00:12:21.507 --> 00:12:27.180
Since you're begging so much,
then I just might apologize for you.

00:12:33.219 --> 00:12:34.954
What is this?

00:12:34.954 --> 00:12:38.124
It's not like we disturbed
your territory or anything.

00:12:38.124 --> 00:12:40.827
Master, are you all right?

00:12:41.961 --> 00:12:43.730
A giant stag beetle...

00:13:11.457 --> 00:13:13.826
All just as we planned!

00:13:15.862 --> 00:13:20.133
If we came this far, even that
super evil sorcerer can't follow!

00:13:20.767 --> 00:13:24.671
That's fine, but my body's all gooey
with this liquid, Big Brother.

00:13:24.904 --> 00:13:26.472
What are you saying, Dortin?

00:13:26.472 --> 00:13:28.608
This syrup is pretty good!

00:13:29.142 --> 00:13:30.643
You're right.

00:13:36.883 --> 00:13:38.851
It's just caterpillars.

00:13:39.419 --> 00:13:41.521
Damn, what's with those guys anyway?

00:13:41.521 --> 00:13:44.257
Put a teensy bit on their tab and
they get so mad their eyes change color.

00:13:44.257 --> 00:13:45.958
They can't take a joke!

00:13:46.426 --> 00:13:48.995
But there's one thing I understand.

00:13:48.995 --> 00:13:52.432
Next time we meet that sorcerer...

00:13:52.999 --> 00:13:54.667
we're going to be killed.

00:13:56.936 --> 00:13:58.171
Definitely.

00:13:59.005 --> 00:14:01.908
Stupid! What?! As if I'd just take this beating!

00:14:01.908 --> 00:14:03.743
Counterattack! Counterattack!

00:14:03.743 --> 00:14:07.647
<i>I'll show them Sir Volcan's true strength!</i>

00:14:08.448 --> 00:14:12.985
But how are you going to show them
that shallow true strength?

00:14:12.985 --> 00:14:16.055
That's... Well, that's...

00:14:16.289 --> 00:14:18.391
You know...

00:14:19.792 --> 00:14:21.928
So? So? What are you going to do?

00:14:22.695 --> 00:14:24.330
B-Big Brother?

00:14:24.964 --> 00:14:27.266
Oh! Oh no! It tickles!

00:14:29.035 --> 00:14:32.338
What? That's pretty forward of you guys!

00:14:33.406 --> 00:14:37.510
It seems that they're here
for the stuff on our bodies.

00:14:38.211 --> 00:14:41.481
Don't play around! Don't get attached to me!
Don't stick to me!

00:14:44.083 --> 00:14:45.418
Face right.

00:14:46.452 --> 00:14:47.620
Face left.

00:14:48.788 --> 00:14:52.291
Amazing! They got attached to you all at once!

00:14:52.291 --> 00:14:55.628
Even bugs realize that you're at their level.

00:14:56.896 --> 00:14:59.132
This... I can use this.

00:15:03.703 --> 00:15:05.738
Volcan! Dortin!

00:15:05.738 --> 00:15:07.473
Where did you go?!

00:15:07.473 --> 00:15:09.275
Come out!

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:18.451
Volcan?

00:15:18.451 --> 00:15:19.452
Where are you?

00:15:19.452 --> 00:15:20.853
Hurry up and come out!

00:15:20.853 --> 00:15:23.556
We just want the Sword of Baltanders!

00:15:23.956 --> 00:15:26.526
We just want you to return it!

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:30.830
Big Brother, he says he only wants
the Sword of Baltanders.

00:15:31.497 --> 00:15:33.065
Don't be fooled, Dortin!

00:15:33.065 --> 00:15:35.735
They're aiming for our lives!

00:15:35.735 --> 00:15:37.804
It's revenge for the eat and run!

00:15:37.804 --> 00:15:38.805
Big Brother?

00:15:38.805 --> 00:15:40.173
| won't let that happen!

00:15:40.173 --> 00:15:42.975
You're going to have to fight these guys!

00:15:43.276 --> 00:15:44.677
What is this?

00:15:51.584 --> 00:15:54.587
What a useless, icky attack!

00:16:02.662 --> 00:16:04.964
This is pretty good for Volcan and gang.

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:12.872
Over there!

00:16:13.473 --> 00:16:16.108
"Sorry! Sir Volcan is super!

00:16:16.108 --> 00:16:18.845
He's the best looking guy
on the Kielsarihima continent!"

00:16:18.845 --> 00:16:20.580
If you say that, I might forgive you.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.149
Oh, and don't forget to kowtow too.

00:16:23.683 --> 00:16:26.419
What? Why are you acting so foolhardy?

00:16:27.019 --> 00:16:28.154
| got it.

00:16:28.154 --> 00:16:29.455
Master!

00:16:29.455 --> 00:16:33.092
Il do as you say. So return the sword.

00:16:33.493 --> 00:16:35.962
That sword's more important than my life.

00:16:35.962 --> 00:16:37.230
Orphen?

00:16:38.931 --> 00:16:39.932
Cleao?

00:16:40.566 --> 00:16:42.335
He said he'd do as we told him.

00:16:42.335 --> 00:16:44.670
That's right. This is definitely victory!

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:47.540
| was waiting for this moment, this second!

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:51.377
When I think about it,
they were hard days, right, Dortin?

00:16:51.777 --> 00:16:53.946
Gold coins are raining from the sky!

00:16:53.946 --> 00:16:56.616
From the sky? Gold coins?
Where are they? Where?!

00:17:05.625 --> 00:17:09.095
I'll have you return this! This sword!

00:17:10.196 --> 00:17:13.499
Deceiving me with such offensive tactics!
You coward!

00:17:13.766 --> 00:17:14.901
Cleao, Majic!

00:17:15.067 --> 00:17:17.203
Orphen, I got it back!

00:17:17.203 --> 00:17:18.738
Let go, you!

00:17:18.738 --> 00:17:21.741
If you want it so bad,
| won't give it back to you ever!

00:17:21.741 --> 00:17:23.509
This is ours!

00:17:23.509 --> 00:17:25.311
What kind of willful nonsense are you saying?

00:17:39.425 --> 00:17:41.360
Cleao, Majic! Watch out!

00:17:51.971 --> 00:17:53.606
Cleao, Majic...

00:17:57.276 --> 00:17:58.611
You...

00:18:14.794 --> 00:18:16.596
Majic, hold on!

00:18:16.596 --> 00:18:17.663
| can't!

00:18:17.663 --> 00:18:20.099
If I do that then, Cleao, you...

00:18:21.233 --> 00:18:22.234
Majic...

00:18:27.907 --> 00:18:30.977
MAJIC!

00:18:36.349 --> 00:18:37.516
Master!

00:18:37.516 --> 00:18:38.985
It's big, but it's still a crow.

00:18:39.418 --> 00:18:41.454
It can't resist shiny things.

00:18:41.854 --> 00:18:43.189
Majic, let's go!

00:18:43.189 --> 00:18:44.156
Yes!

00:18:51.063 --> 00:18:54.266
You! You got some kind of attitude
making me your food!

00:18:54.266 --> 00:18:57.103
I'll kill you like I kill my alarm clock
in the morning! Take this!

00:18:57.103 --> 00:18:59.171
Big Brother, don't move around!

00:19:05.478 --> 00:19:06.379
Cleao!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:11.150
Cleao, it's all right, let go! I'll catch you!

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:12.351
No!

00:19:12.351 --> 00:19:14.320
There's no way I can let go!

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:16.188
This is your important sword, Orphen!

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:21.027
Orphen's caught up with us, you trashy crow!

00:19:21.027 --> 00:19:23.329
Can't you fly any faster?

00:19:23.329 --> 00:19:24.664
Big Brother!

00:19:31.737 --> 00:19:32.638
Majic!

00:19:32.638 --> 00:19:33.539
Yes!

00:19:35.474 --> 00:19:36.609
Hey, Cleao!
Majic?

00:19:37.943 --> 00:19:41.080
That I let flow, Breath of an Angel!

00:19:50.523 --> 00:19:51.624
Idiots!

00:19:51.624 --> 00:19:53.192
You're trying too hard!

00:19:53.893 --> 00:19:56.128
Really, they're both idiots.

00:19:56.462 --> 00:19:58.364
I'm sorry, Master.

00:19:58.364 --> 00:20:02.601
Sorry. We were so close to getting
the Sword of Baltanders back.

00:20:02.835 --> 00:20:05.071
Stupid, what kind of face is that?

00:20:05.438 --> 00:20:06.505
Orphen?

00:20:06.505 --> 00:20:08.307
Well, it will all turn out.

00:20:09.175 --> 00:20:10.242
Right?

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:12.845
Hey, that's enough already!

00:20:12.845 --> 00:20:15.514
Hurry up and let us down, you stupid crow!

00:20:15.848 --> 00:20:18.851
Hurry up and let us down, you dumb crow!

00:20:18.851 --> 00:20:23.222
God, when I'm reborn, I really want
to be an only child next time!

00:20:23.222 --> 00:20:24.390
What did you say?

00:20:35.701 --> 00:20:36.736
Leki?

00:20:41.607 --> 00:20:43.609
See? It all turned out fine, didn't it?

00:21:01.293 --> 00:21:02.962
My refill of beer, isn't it ready yet?

00:21:02.962 --> 00:21:05.231
My food's not here yet!

00:21:05.231 --> 00:21:07.600
Waiter! Hey, come take my order!

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:09.301
Yes, I'm coming!

00:21:09.769 --> 00:21:13.405
Why do we have to do such things?

00:21:14.173 --> 00:21:15.341
Hey!

00:21:15.341 --> 00:21:16.308
Yes...

00:21:16.308 --> 00:21:21.180
You better work to earn enough
for the food and the repairs.

00:21:21.614 --> 00:21:25.351
Understand? You won't be able to run away!

00:21:25.351 --> 00:21:26.519
Yes!

00:21:30.289 --> 00:21:32.591
Well now, the sword is back

00:21:32.591 --> 00:21:34.994
and next is the Ruins of Baltanders, right?

00:21:34.994 --> 00:21:40.432
There's a long way to go,
and we suffered so much to get the sword.

00:21:40.432 --> 00:21:42.601
You can't even begin to worry about it.

00:21:42.601 --> 00:21:44.170
It will all turn out fine!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:49.608
You know, those words are the words of
someone who's actually trying to do something.

00:21:49.608 --> 00:21:51.577
Right, Master?

00:21:53.145 --> 00:21:54.380
Yeah, that's true.

00:21:55.281 --> 00:21:56.582
So...

00:21:57.850 --> 00:21:59.218
we'll do something.

00:22:03.222 --> 00:22:04.890
Come on, let's go.

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:20.239
| want to see Bloody August.

00:22:20.239 --> 00:22:22.374
| want to see Azalie once more.

00:22:23.042 --> 00:22:24.910
What are you doing, Black Tiger?

00:22:24.910 --> 00:22:28.314
To be after me is bad enough, but Cleao too?

00:22:28.881 --> 00:22:31.917
You say that Childman was trying to save Azalie?

00:22:31.917 --> 00:22:35.721
That's a lie! Then what is he doing now?!

